    to :meth:`~astropy.coordinates.Angle.to_string`.

    Parameters
    ----------
    style : {'hmsdms', 'dms', 'decimal'}
        The formatting specification to use. These encode the three most
        common ways to represent coordinates. The default is `decimal`.
    **kwargs
